    {
      "text": "Three Witnesses to testify, D&C 17:3. elders to testify that words are of the Lord, not men, D&C 18:34. testify that you have heard my voice, D&C 18:36. prophets testified of Christ in all things, D&C 20:26 (138:36, 49). those who put away companions because of fornication and testify before elders in lowliness of heart shall not be cast out, D&C 42:74. do that which the Spirit testifies unto you, D&C 46:7. Christ to testify for faithful, D&C 88:75. the Lord sends elders out to testify and warn, D&C 88:81. things written in book of Enoch2 are to be testified of in due time, D&C 107:57. Malachi testified that Elijah should be sent, D&C 110:14.",
